            <ArticleTitle>Arterial revascularization--advantages and pitfalls.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>235-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Arterial revascularization is still subject to debate, even though numerous publications have reported presumed advantages of arterial over venous grafts. This brief review summarizes current knowledge on arterial revascularization on a practical basis.</AbstractText>
